{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id416601962"}, "name":{"label":"A. Rümeysa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-06-24T06:38:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"6116308211"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect"}, "content":{"label":"The app is stunning! I was looking for a relaxing soothing background sounds playing app and when I found portal I was amazed! This app has a very nice interface it’s really easy to use the only downside is the limited sounds you get for free. If you want to unlock the other sounds you have to make an on off payment for about seven euros. But other than that it’s amazing and my favorite is the log fire. \nI usually don’t go on the App Store and make a review about the app but portal is just stunning I had to do it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id144746378"}, "name":{"label":"Reiner(G)"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-06-24T05:08:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"6116028955"}, "title":{"label":"Ausgezeichnet"}, "content":{"label":"Im wahrsten Sinne des Wortes!\na) Einmalpreis (KEIN Abo) 👍🏻\nb) Visuelle Effekte kombiniert mit Philips Hue 👍🏻\nc) Soundeffekte verteilt via AirDrop zur Soundanlage, klasse die Stimmung im Raum, kombiniert mit b) den Licheffekten👍🏻\nd) Gesundheit integriert durch Atemübungen 👍🏻\n\nAlso, Daumen hoch und 5 Sterne ⭐️ \n(Das passiert mir nicht oft, dass ich mit Überzeugung so positiv schreibe)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
