{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id656731982"}, "name":{"label":"NF25899"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-05-14T13:01:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5945477514"}, "title":{"label":"Very good for relaxation"}, "content":{"label":"This app gives you 19 different longplay-sounds and „3D“-videos that can help to calm down plus breathing exercises (simple, and they work). My favorites are still aquarium and whales. My former complaints about the iPad app were heard and now everything is fine. This is a great thing: one app instead of 19 CDs. Thank you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id297478473"}, "name":{"label":"Jannik Steins"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-05-08T14:45:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5920788062"}, "title":{"label":"Unbelievable!!"}, "content":{"label":"This app is probably the best app I have ever used and definitely worth its money. It’s easy to use and beautiful designed. The soundscapes are amazing and have a stunning quality. If you listen to them with headphones, it seems like you are at another place. Alle the little functions like breathing exercises and sleep timer make the app even better and the sync with the hue lights completes the app in its whole.\n\nThank you for creating this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1436994560&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
